  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──冬優子\r\n人気投票の方、調子はどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00129",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030010,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "順調よ、当たり前じゃない\r\nふゆのマーケティング力舐めないでよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "018",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "自分のフィールドで勝負しちゃって、\r\n子どもっぽかったかなって、ちょっと後悔してるくらい",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "次はあいつらの得意分野で勝ってやるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、今回は勝つ前提か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふ、当たり前じゃない\r\nあいつらには絶対負けないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "…………\r\n……………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "………………時々思うのよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もしふゆがソロだったり、ユニットでもあいつらみたいな\r\n面倒なやつと一緒じゃなかったら、どうなってたかって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n……………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もちろん、上手くやってたに決まってるわ\r\n今よりずっと心穏やかにね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "けど……………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──ほら、よく言うじゃない\r\n壁は高い方が燃えるって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "壁……か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ええ、壁よ\r\n足蹴にして乗り越えるべきね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それかペースメーカーってやつ\r\nマラソンで前を走ってペースを作ってもらうあれ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ま、最後には切り捨てるんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "切り捨てるのか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "トーゼン、ふゆがトップになるための踏み台でしかないわ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あんただって、それを見越して\r\nふゆとあさひを一緒のユニットにしたんでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………踏み台、とは思ってないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。確かに、あさひと愛依と一緒なら、\r\n冬優子はより強くなれると思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "スパルタもいいところね\r\nふゆじゃなかったらどうなってたか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子だから大丈夫って思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……あそ\r\n口だけは上手ね、ほんと",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400102303/4001023030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そういうことにしとくさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001023030180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
